            owl:onClass <http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/TransportationSystem/Network> ;
            owl:onProperty <http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/TransportationSystem/controlsNetworks> ],
        <http://ontology.eil.utoronto.ca/icity/TransportationSystem/TransportationOntologyThing> .

